{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a fully custom Shopify OS 2.0 section named custom-featured-collection-modern to replace the default featured-collection section.
    
    GOAL: Build a premium, modern, minimal, high-converting featured collection section that initially displays 50 products, then automatically loads 20 more products as the user scrolls down (infinite scroll / lazy loading style). The design must feel elegant, lightweight, mobile-friendly, and optimized for conversion.
    
    CORE FUNCTIONALITY: Initially render 50 products. When the user scrolls near the bottom of the section, automatically load the next 20 products. Continue loading in batches of 20 until all products in the selected collection are shown. Use progressive lazy loading / infinite scroll behavior. Avoid page reload. Prevent duplicate loads. Show a loading indicator while fetching more products. Hide the loading trigger when no more products remain. Must be performant and smooth on mobile and desktop.
    
    SECTION SETTINGS: Section heading, optional subheading, collection picker, initial products to show (default 50), load more batch size (default 20), desktop columns per row (2 to 4), mobile columns per row (1 to 2), show Add to Cart button checkbox, show rating checkbox, show compare-at price checkbox, show discount percentage checkbox, show vendor checkbox, optional View All button text and link, card border radius, section padding top/bottom.
    
    PRODUCT CARD MEDIA: If a product has video, show product video as primary media. If no video exists, fall back to featured image. On hover autoplay muted looping inline video if video exists, otherwise apply subtle image zoom. Video must be muted, loop, play inline, have no controls. Use consistent aspect ratio for all product cards.
    
    CARD CONTENT: Product title with max 2 lines CSS line clamp. Pricing with current price prominently, compare-at price struck through, discount percentage badge formatted like -35%. Rating using Shopify rating metafield hidden cleanly if not available. Add to Cart button with modern minimal ghost style, AJAX add to cart for single-variant products, go to product page for multiple variants, show loading and sold out states. Optional vendor as small subtle text above title.
    
    INFINITE SCROLL: Render first 50 products in Liquid. Load next 20 products asynchronously using JavaScript. Use Shopify collection pagination. Append new cards into the same grid without layout shift. Use IntersectionObserver with a sentinel element near the bottom. Add debounce and load lock so multiple requests do not fire simultaneously. Stop observing when all products are loaded. Show a minimal loading spinner while fetching. If JavaScript fails, section still shows first 50 products properly.
    
    DESIGN STYLE: Premium, minimal, modern, conversion-focused. Inspired by high-end fashion and lifestyle stores. Clean white or soft light card background. Soft shadow or ultra-subtle border. Smooth hover animation. Rounded corners. Modern sans-serif typography. Balanced spacing. No bulky borders or clutter.
    
    LAYOUT: Responsive CSS grid. Desktop columns 2 to 4. Mobile columns 1 to 2. Cards remain consistent with long titles. Supports large collections gracefully.
    
    TECHNICAL: Semantic HTML, accessible markup, keyboard accessible. Use Shopify money filters. Calculate discount percentage dynamically. Clean reusable card markup. Minimal well-commented JavaScript. No jQuery or external frameworks. AJAX add to cart and video hover behavior must also work on lazy-loaded cards.
    
    OUTPUT: Full Shopify section Liquid file, embedded scoped CSS, vanilla JavaScript for video hover, AJAX add to cart, and infinite scroll lazy loading, full schema, clean comments. Make this production-ready and premium — not like a default Dawn section.
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  assign section_id = section.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase
  assign collection = section.settings.collection
  assign initial_products_count = section.settings.initial_products_count
  assign load_more_count = section.settings.load_more_count
  assign desktop_columns = section.settings.desktop_columns
  assign mobile_columns = section.settings.mobile_columns
  assign show_add_to_cart = section.settings.show_add_to_cart
  assign show_rating = section.settings.show_rating
  assign show_compare_at_price = section.settings.show_compare_at_price
  assign show_discount_badge = section.settings.show_discount_badge
  assign show_vendor = section.settings.show_vendor
%}

{% style %}
  .cfcm-section-{{ section_id }} {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: #fdfbf7;
  }

  .cfcm-container-{{ section_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .cfcm-header-{{ section_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .cfcm-heading-{{ section_id }} {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #2e2a39;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .cfcm-subheading-{{ section_id }} {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #6b6576;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cfcm-grid-{{ section_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat({{ mobile_columns }}, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .cfcm-grid-{{ section_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ desktop_columns }}, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .cfcm-heading-{{ section_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }

    .cfcm-subheading-{{ section_id }} {
      font-size: 18px;
    }
  }

  .cfcm-card-{{ section_id }} {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: {{ section.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(46, 42, 57, 0.06);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .cfcm-card-{{ section_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(46, 42, 57, 0.12);
  }

  .cfcm-media-wrapper-{{ section_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 125%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #f5f5f5;
  }

  .cfcm-media-{{ section_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  .cfcm-card-{{ section_id }}:hover .cfcm-media-{{ section_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .cfcm-video-{{ section_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .cfcm-badge-wrapper-{{ section_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    left: 12px;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .cfcm-badge-{{ section_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    background: #9b046f;
    color: #fdfbf7;
  }

  .cfcm-badge-sold-out-{{ section_id }} {
    background: #2e2a39;
  }

  .cfcm-content-{{ section_id }} {
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .cfcm-vendor-{{ section_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #9b9b9b;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cfcm-title-{{ section_id }} {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #2e2a39;
    margin: 0;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    min-height: 44px;
  }

  .cfcm-title-link-{{ section_id }} {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .cfcm-title-link-{{ section_id }}:hover {
    color: #9b046f;
  }

  .cfcm-rating-{{ section_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #2e2a39;
  }

  .cfcm-stars-{{ section_id }} {
    color: #ffa500;
  }

  .cfcm-price-wrapper-{{ section_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cfcm-price-{{ section_id }} {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #2e2a39;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cfcm-compare-price-{{ section_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #9b9b9b;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .cfcm-add-to-cart-{{ section_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border: 1px solid #2e2a39;
    background: transparent;
    color: #2e2a39;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .cfcm-add-to-cart-{{ section_id }}:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: #2e2a39;
    color: #fdfbf7;
  }

  .cfcm-add-to-cart-{{ section_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .cfcm-add-to-cart-{{ section_id }}.loading {
    position: relative;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .cfcm-add-to-cart-{{ section_id }}.loading::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border: 2px solid #2e2a39;
    border-top-color: transparent;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: cfcm-spin-{{ section_id }} 0.6s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes cfcm-spin-{{ section_id }} {
    to { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(360deg); }
  }

  .cfcm-sentinel-{{ section_id }} {
    height: 1px;
    margin: 40px 0;
  }

  .cfcm-loading-{{ section_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .cfcm-spinner-{{ section_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border: 3px solid #f3f3f3;
    border-top: 3px solid #9b046f;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: cfcm-spin-{{ section_id }} 0.8s linear infinite;
  }

  .cfcm-loading-text-{{ section_id }} {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #6b6576;
  }

  .cfcm-view-all-wrapper-{{ section_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .cfcm-view-all-{{ section_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    background: #9b046f;
    color: #fdfbf7;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .cfcm-view-all-{{ section_id }}:hover {
    background: #7a0358;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(155, 4, 111, 0.3);
  }

  .cfcm-hidden-{{ section_id }} {
    display: none;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<custom-featured-collection-{{ section_id }} class="cfcm-section-{{ section_id }}">
  <div class="cfcm-container-{{ section_id }}">
    {% if section.settings.heading != blank or section.settings.subheading != blank %}
      <div class="cfcm-header-{{ section_id }}">
        {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="cfcm-heading-{{ section_id }}">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if section.settings.subheading != blank %}
          <p class="cfcm-subheading-{{ section_id }}">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if collection != blank and collection.products.size > 0 %}
      <div class="cfcm-grid-{{ section_id }}" data-grid>
        {% for product in collection.products limit: initial_products_count %}
          {% liquid
            assign has_video = false
            assign product_video = null
            
            for media in product.media
              if media.media_type == 'video' or media.media_type == 'external_video'
                assign has_video = true
                assign product_video = media
                break
              endif
            endfor

            assign discount_percentage = 0
            if product.compare_at_price > product.price
              assign discount_amount = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price
              assign discount_percentage = discount_amount | times: 100.0 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price | round
            endif

            assign rating_value = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value | default: 0
            assign rating_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count | default: 0
          %}

          <div class="cfcm-card-{{ section_id }}">
            <div class="cfcm-media-wrapper-{{ section_id }}">
              {% if has_video %}
                <video 
                  class="cfcm-video-{{ section_id }}"
                  muted
                  loop
                  playsinline
                  preload="metadata"
                >
                  <source src="{{ product_video.sources[0].url }}" type="{{ product_video.sources[0].mime_type }}">
                </video>
              {% elsif product.featured_image %}
                <img 
                  class="cfcm-media-{{ section_id }}"
                  src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                  alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="600"
                  height="750"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="cfcm-media-{{ section_id }}" style="background: #f5f5f5;"></div>
              {% endif %}

              {% if show_discount_badge and discount_percentage > 0 or product.available == false %}
                <div class="cfcm-badge-wrapper-{{ section_id }}">
                  {% if product.available == false %}
                    <span class="cfcm-badge-{{ section_id }} cfcm-badge-sold-out-{{ section_id }}">Sold Out</span>
                  {% elsif show_discount_badge and discount_percentage > 0 %}
                    <span class="cfcm-badge-{{ section_id }}">-{{ discount_percentage }}%</span>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="cfcm-content-{{ section_id }}">
              {% if show_vendor and product.vendor != blank %}
                <p class="cfcm-vendor-{{ section_id }}">{{ product.vendor }}</p>
              {% endif %}

              <h3 class="cfcm-title-{{ section_id }}">
                <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="cfcm-title-link-{{ section_id }}">
                  {{ product.title }}
                </a>
              </h3>

              {% if show_rating and rating_value > 0 %}
                <div class="cfcm-rating-{{ section_id }}">
                  <span class="cfcm-stars-{{ section_id }}">
                    {% for i in (1..5) %}
                      {% if i <= rating_value %}★{% else %}☆{% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                  </span>
                  <span>({{ rating_count }})</span>
                </div>
              {% endif %}

              <div class="cfcm-price-wrapper-{{ section_id }}">
                <p class="cfcm-price-{{ section_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</p>
                {% if show_compare_at_price and product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                  <p class="cfcm-compare-price-{{ section_id }}">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</p>
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              {% if show_add_to_cart %}
                <button 
                  class="cfcm-add-to-cart-{{ section_id }}"
                  data-product-id="{{ product.handle }}"
                  data-variant-id="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}"
                  data-variant-count="{{ product.variants.size }}"
                  {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
                >
                  {% if product.available %}
                    {% if product.variants.size > 1 %}
                      Select Options
                    {% else %}
                      Add to Cart
                    {% endif %}
                  {% else %}
                    Sold Out
                  {% endif %}
                </button>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      {% if collection.products.size > initial_products_count %}
        <div class="cfcm-sentinel-{{ section_id }}" data-sentinel></div>
        <div class="cfcm-loading-{{ section_id }} cfcm-hidden-{{ section_id }}" data-loading>
          <div class="cfcm-spinner-{{ section_id }}"></div>
          <p class="cfcm-loading-text-{{ section_id }}">Loading more products...</p>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if section.settings.view_all_text != blank and section.settings.view_all_link != blank %}
        <div class="cfcm-view-all-wrapper-{{ section_id }}">
          <a href="{{ section.settings.view_all_link }}" class="cfcm-view-all-{{ section_id }}">
            {{ section.settings.view_all_text }}
          </a>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <div style="text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px; color: #6b6576;">
        <p style="font-size: 18px; margin: 0;">No collection selected or collection is empty.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px;">Please select a collection in the section settings.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</custom-featured-collection-{{ section_id }}>

<script>
(function() {
  class CustomFeaturedCollection{{ section_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    constructor() {
      super();
      this.sectionId = '{{ section_id }}';
      this.collectionHandle = '{{ collection.handle }}';
      this.totalProducts = {{ collection.products.size | default: 0 }};
      this.initialCount = {{ initial_products_count }};
      this.loadMoreCount = {{ load_more_count }};
      this.currentPage = 1;
      this.isLoading = false;
      this.allLoaded = false;
      
      this.grid = this.querySelector('[data-grid]');
      this.sentinel = this.querySelector('[data-sentinel]');
      this.loadingIndicator = this.querySelector('[data-loading]');
      
      this.showAddToCart = {{ show_add_to_cart | json }};
      this.showRating = {{ show_rating | json }};
      this.showCompareAtPrice = {{ show_compare_at_price | json }};
      this.showDiscountBadge = {{ show_discount_badge | json }};
      this.showVendor = {{ show_vendor | json }};
    }

    connectedCallback() {
      if (this.totalProducts <= this.initialCount) {
        this.allLoaded = true;
        return;
      }

      this.setupIntersectionObserver();
      this.setupEventDelegation();
    }

    setupIntersectionObserver() {
      if (!this.sentinel) return;

      const options = {
        root: null,
        rootMargin: '200px',
        threshold: 0
      };

      this.observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
        entries.forEach(entry => {
          if (entry.isIntersecting && !this.isLoading && !this.allLoaded) {
            this.loadMoreProducts();
          }
        });
      }, options);

      this.observer.observe(this.sentinel);
    }

    async loadMoreProducts() {
      if (this.isLoading || this.allLoaded) return;

      this.isLoading = true;
      this.showLoading();

      const loadedCount = this.grid.children.length;
      if (loadedCount >= this.totalProducts) {
        this.allLoaded = true;
        this.hideLoading();
        this.hideSentinel();
        this.isLoading = false;
        return;
      }

      const nextPage = Math.floor(loadedCount / this.loadMoreCount) + 1;
      
      try {
        const response = await fetch(
          `/collections/${this.collectionHandle}?view=ajax-products&page=${nextPage}&limit=${this.loadMoreCount}&offset=${loadedCount}`
        );
        
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Network response was not ok');
        
        const html = await response.text();
        const parser = new DOMParser();
        const doc = parser.parseFromString(html, 'text/html');
        const newProducts = doc.querySelectorAll('.cfcm-card-' + this.sectionId);
        
        if (newProducts.length === 0) {
          this.allLoaded = true;
          this.hideSentinel();
        } else {
          newProducts.forEach(product => {
            this.grid.appendChild(product.cloneNode(true));
          });

          const totalLoaded = this.grid.children.length;
          if (totalLoaded >= this.totalProducts) {
            this.allLoaded = true;
            this.hideSentinel();
          }
        }
      } catch (error) {
        console.error('Error loading products:', error);
      } finally {
        this.hideLoading();
        this.isLoading = false;
      }
    }

    setupEventDelegation() {
      this.grid.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        const button = e.target.closest('.cfcm-add-to-cart-' + this.sectionId);
        if (button && !button.disabled) {
          this.handleAddToCart(button);
        }
      });

      this.grid.addEventListener('mouseenter', (e) => {
        const card = e.target.closest('.cfcm-card-' + this.sectionId);
        if (card) {
          const video = card.querySelector('.cfcm-video-' + this.sectionId);
          if (video) {
            video.play().catch(() => {});
          }
        }
      }, true);

      this.grid.addEventListener('mouseleave', (e) => {
        const card = e.target.closest('.cfcm-card-' + this.sectionId);
        if (card) {
          const video = card.querySelector('.cfcm-video-' + this.sectionId);
          if (video) {
            video.pause();
            video.currentTime = 0;
          }
        }
      }, true);
    }

    async handleAddToCart(button) {
      const productId = button.dataset.productId;
      const variantId = button.dataset.variantId;
      const variantCount = parseInt(button.dataset.variantCount);

      if (variantCount > 1) {
        window.location.href = `/products/${productId}`;
        return;
      }

      button.classList.add('loading');
      button.disabled = true;

      try {
        const response = await fetch('/cart/add.js', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: {
            'Content-Type': 'application/json',
          },
          body: JSON.stringify({
            id: variantId,
            quantity: 1
          })
        });

        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Failed to add to cart');

        const data = await response.json();
        
        if (window.theme && window.theme.cart) {
          window.theme.cart.refresh();
        }
        
        document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:item-added', { detail: data }));
        
        button.textContent = 'Added!';
        setTimeout(() => {
          button.textContent = 'Add to Cart';
          button.classList.remove('loading');
          button.disabled = false;
        }, 2000);
      } catch (error) {
        console.error('Error adding to cart:', error);
        button.textContent = 'Error';
        setTimeout(() => {
          button.textContent = 'Add to Cart';
          button.classList.remove('loading');
          button.disabled = false;
        }, 2000);
      }
    }

    showLoading() {
      if (this.loadingIndicator) {
        this.loadingIndicator.classList.remove('cfcm-hidden-' + this.sectionId);
      }
    }

    hideLoading() {
      if (this.loadingIndicator) {
        this.loadingIndicator.classList.add('cfcm-hidden-' + this.sectionId);
      }
    }

    hideSentinel() {
      if (this.sentinel) {
        this.sentinel.style.display = 'none';
      }
      if (this.observer) {
        this.observer.disconnect();
      }
    }
  }

  customElements.define('custom-featured-collection-{{ section_id }}', CustomFeaturedCollection{{ section_id }});
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Collection modern",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-featured-collection-modern",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Featured Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "Discover our curated selection"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Loading settings"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "initial_products_count",
      "min": 4,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 2,
      "label": "Initial products",
      "default": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "load_more_count",
      "min": 4,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 4,
      "label": "Products per load",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Layout"
    },
    {
